# KALPATARU BOYS HOSTEL MANAGEMENT SYSTEM
## Complete Full-Stack Application Development Prompt for Google AI Studio

### 1. Project Overview

Build a complete, functional, responsive web application called **Kalpataru Boys Hostel Management System** for managing hostel students, room allocation, hostel fees, mess fees, online and manual payments, complaints, and SMS reminders.

This must be a real full-stack application, not a static design or demo with fake data.

Use Google AI Studio to develop the application. Use Firebase Authentication for user authentication, Cloud Firestore for database storage, Firebase Storage for profile photos and complaint attachments, and secure server-side logic using Firebase Cloud Functions or another suitable trusted backend.

Integrate a legitimate payment gateway for online payments and an SMS provider for actual SMS reminders. Keep all secret API keys on the server.

The system must have two separate portals:
1. Student Portal
2. Administrator Portal

Both portals must use the same database with strict role-based access control.

